Spoiler ahead

Just drop water on any non co-aligned altar, stand on the altar and #pray.
The water will become unholy water, but your God will be pissed off.

Another option is to get a Lich to curse it.

You could also wish for it, or just wait till one is created.

I don't know exactly, but I thought that quaffing from a fountain has
a chance to curse something in your inventory. If this happens to be water
because there is nothing else, it will become unholy water. But if that
quaffing summons a Water Demon, you'll be in serious troubles...

